- Every material change goes through `/update` (SQLite + CHANGELOG always; STATE if numbers moved; DECISIONS if a choice).
- Do not park new open questions if a policy decision (or "pick IDs at /deploy") will close them.
- Live APY/TVL need **source + date**. Unsourced numbers stay labeled unverified.
- This pack is a personal adventure log, not financial advice and not a promise of $100/day.
